  "<p class=\"rt-eyebrow\">Sandbox · play money</p>": "<p class=\"rt-eyebrow\">沙盒 · 虚拟资金</p>",
  "<h1 class=\"rt-h2\">Run the vault yourself.</h1>": "<h1 class=\"rt-h2\">亲自运行这个金库。</h1>",
  "      The same rules as the contract, with nothing real at stake. Take some EURG from the tap,\n      deposit it, close a month and watch the price move, then cash out and see the curve take its cut.\n      <b>Everyone on this page shares one vault</b>: what you do, the next visitor sees.": "      规则与合约完全相同，但没有任何真实风险。从水龙头取一些 EURG，存进去，结算一个月看价格变动，\n      再取出来看曲线税如何扣除。<b>本页所有人共用同一个金库</b>：你做的事，下一位访客都能看到。",
  "<p class=\"rt-eyebrow\">You</p>": "<p class=\"rt-eyebrow\">你</p>",
  "<h2 class=\"rt-h4\" id=\"sb-you-h\">Who is depositing?</h2>": "<h2 class=\"rt-h4\" id=\"sb-you-h\">谁在存入？</h2>",
  "<span>A name for the holders list</span>": "<span>在持有人名单上显示的名字</span>",
  "placeholder=\"e.g. Marta\"": "placeholder=\"例如：小雨\"",
  "id=\"sb-guest\">Continue as guest</button>": "id=\"sb-guest\">以访客身份继续</button>",
  "id=\"sb-wallet\">Connect wallet</button>": "id=\"sb-wallet\">连接钱包</button>",
  "<p class=\"rt-sb-fine\">A wallet signs one message to prove it is yours. No transaction, no gas, nothing goes on chain, and the sandbox never asks for real EURG.</p>": "<p class=\"rt-sb-fine\">钱包只需签署一条消息来证明它属于你。没有交易，没有 gas，不会上链，沙盒也永远不会索要真实的 EURG。</p>",
  "id=\"sb-signout\">Switch</button>": "id=\"sb-signout\">切换</button>",
  "<dt>EURG in hand</dt>": "<dt>手头 EURG</dt>",
  "<dt>vRENTA</dt>": "<dt>vRENTA</dt>",
  "<dt>Worth today</dt>": "<dt>今日价值</dt>",
  "<dt>Curve tax now</dt>": "<dt>当前曲线税</dt>",
  "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\">The tap</h3>": "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\">水龙头</h3>",
  "<p>€25,000 of play EURG each time, up to €100,000 in hand.</p>": "<p>每次 €25,000 虚拟 EURG，手头最多 €100,000。</p>",
  "id=\"sb-tap\" data-needs-me>Take €25,000</button>": "id=\"sb-tap\" data-needs-me>领取 €25,000</button>",
  "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\">Deposit</h3>": "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\">存入</h3>",
  "<p>EURG in, vRENTA out at today’s price. From €100.</p>": "<p>存入 EURG，按今日价格换成 vRENTA。€100 起。</p>",
  "aria-label=\"EURG to deposit\"": "aria-label=\"存入的 EURG\"",
  "id=\"sb-deposit\" data-needs-me>Deposit</button>": "id=\"sb-deposit\" data-needs-me>存入</button>",
  "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\">Redeem</h3>": "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\">赎回</h3>",
  "<p>vRENTA in, EURG out. Within 90 days of a deposit the curve keeps up to 3%.</p>": "<p>交回 vRENTA，取出 EURG。存入后 90 天内，曲线税最多扣 3%。</p>",
  "placeholder=\"all\" aria-label=\"vRENTA to redeem\"": "placeholder=\"全部\" aria-label=\"赎回的 vRENTA\"",
  "id=\"sb-redeem\" data-needs-me>Redeem</button>": "id=\"sb-redeem\" data-needs-me>赎回</button>",
  "<p class=\"rt-eyebrow\">The vault</p>": "<p class=\"rt-eyebrow\">金库</p>",
  "<h2 class=\"rt-h4\" id=\"sb-vault-h\">One vault, everyone’s moves.</h2>": "<h2 class=\"rt-h4\" id=\"sb-vault-h\">一个金库，所有人的操作。</h2>",
  "id=\"sb-reset\" hidden>Reset the sandbox</button>": "id=\"sb-reset\" hidden>重置沙盒</button>",
  "<small>Share price</small>": "<small>份额价格</small>",
  "<small>vRENTA in issue</small>": "<small>已发行 vRENTA</small>",
  "<small>Reserve (EURG)</small>": "<small>储备（EURG）</small>",
  "<small>Buildings at cost</small>": "<small>楼宇（按成本）</small>",
  "<small>Holders</small>": "<small>持有人</small>",
  "<small>Queued for the close</small>": "<small>排队等待结算</small>",
  "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\" id=\"sb-close-h\">Close the month</h3>": "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\" id=\"sb-close-h\">结算本月</h3>",
  "id=\"sb-close\" data-needs-me>Close the month</button>": "id=\"sb-close\" data-needs-me>结算本月</button>",
  "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\">Closes</h3>": "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\">结算记录</h3>",
  "<p class=\"rt-sb-sub\">The first six are the real Rolls. Everything after them happened here.</p>": "<p class=\"rt-sb-sub\">前六条是真实的月报。之后的都发生在这里。</p>",
  "<th>Month</th><th>Collected</th><th>Costs</th><th>Kept</th><th>Price</th><th>Source</th>": "<th>月份</th><th>实收</th><th>成本</th><th>留存</th><th>价格</th><th>来源</th>",
  "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\">Holders</h3>": "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\">持有人</h3>",
  "<th>Name</th><th>vRENTA</th><th>Worth</th>": "<th>名字</th><th>vRENTA</th><th>价值</th>",
  "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\">Ledger</h3>": "<h3 class=\"rt-h4\">流水</h3>",
  "<h2 class=\"rt-h4\">What is real here, and what is not</h2>": "<h2 class=\"rt-h4\">这里什么是真的，什么不是</h2>",
  "<li><b>The rules are the contract’s.</b> Price is what the vault holds divided by the shares in issue. A deposit mints at that price. A redemption pays it minus the curve, 3% on the day of a deposit falling to nothing at 90 days, and the curve stays in the vault for everyone else. A redemption the reserve cannot cover waits for the next close.</li>": "<li><b>规则就是合约的规则。</b>价格等于金库持有的资产除以已发行份额。存入按该价格铸造份额。赎回按该价格支付并扣除曲线税：存入当天 3%，到第 90 天降为零，扣下的部分留在金库归其他人。储备无法支付的赎回，等待下次结算。</li>",
  "<li><b>Time is a month per close.</b> Each close moves the calendar forward a month, so the curve is 3%, 2%, 1%, then gone, depending on how many closes have passed since your last deposit.</li>": "<li><b>时间以每次结算一个月计。</b>每次结算把日历向前推一个月，因此曲线税按你上次存入后经过的结算次数，依次为 3%、2%、1%，然后归零。</li>",
  "<li><b>The rent is simulated.</b> The vault starts where the real Rolls end. From then on each close collects between 90% and 100% of the scheduled rent and pays 26% to 36% of it in costs, fixed for each month so everyone sees the same forecast.</li>": "<li><b>租金是模拟的。</b>金库从真实月报结束处开始。此后每次结算收取应收租金的 90% 至 100%，并支付其中 26% 至 36% 作为成本；每个月的数值固定，所以所有人看到同样的预测。</li>",
  "<li><b>Nothing is money.</b> EURG here comes from a tap, a wallet signs a message and pays no gas, and nothing touches a chain. The real vault, when it goes live, is the contract in <a href=\"docs.html#contracts\">the docs</a>.</li>": "<li><b>这里没有真钱。</b>EURG 来自水龙头，钱包只签署消息、不付 gas，没有任何东西上链。真正的金库上线时，就是<a href=\"docs.html#contracts\">文档</a>中的那份合约。</li>",
  "        RENTA is a demonstration build. The sandbox is a game with play money, and its figures say\n        nothing about what a real vault would do. Nothing here is investment advice.": "        RENTA 是一个演示版本。沙盒是使用虚拟资金的游戏，其数字不能说明真实金库会如何表现。这里没有任何内容构成投资建议。",
  "aria-label=\"RENTA on X (Twitter)\"": "aria-label=\"RENTA 的 X（Twitter）\""
}
